What is DeltΔAddons?
---------------
DeltΔAddons is a custom vendor tree to add extras to your android ROMs. It adds unique sounds and wallpapers, privacy-respecting apps, and some useful utitilies.

Implement it!
---------------
### Comment the project on other .xml's related to these (located in <source>/.repo/manifests and its subfolders):
    * `Backgrounds`
    * `ColumbusService`
    * `ElmyraService`
    * `Launcher3` (optional) (if you dont want to use it, make sure to comment out the project in deltaAddons.xml)

### Download it straight into your local_manifests
* Using curl
```bash
mkdir local_manifests
curl -o .repo/local_manifests/deltaAddons.xml https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeltaPrjkts/local_manifests/refs/heads/<branch>/deltaAddons.xml
```
* Using wget
```bash
mkdir local_manifests
wget -P .repo/local_manifests/deltaAddons.xml https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeltaPrjkts/local_manifests/refs/heads/<branch>/deltaAddons.xml
```

### Integrate it to your ROM source manifests
* Add it as a git submodules
```bash
git submodule add -b <branch> https://github.com/DeltaPrjkts/local_manifests.git ./.repo/manifests/deltaSnippets
```
* Integrate with `default.xml`, add it to the end of the manifests
```xml
<include name="deltaSnippets/deltaAddons.xml" />
```
* Extra: Init / Reinit your repo
If you use forked repos of your ROM source manifests, make sure to push and then reinit the repo
```bash
repo init --submodules -u your_repo -b your_branch --git-lfs
```
